1
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,000
Four continents. Three kills... Or the love of his life is dead.

2
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:06,000
Mechanic: Resurrection is a action, crime,
thriller film directed by Dennis Gansel.

3
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:36,000
Arthur Bishop thought he had put his murderous past behind him when
his most formidable foe kidnaps the love of his life.

4
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
Now he is forced to travel the globe to complete three impossible
assassinations, and do what he does best, make them look like accidents.

5
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:36,000
Arthur Bishop, played by Jason Statham.

6
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:06,000
Gina, played by Jessica Alba.

7
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:36,000
Max Adams, played by Tommy Lee Jones.

8
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Mei, played by Michelle Yeoh.

9
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
Riah Crain, played by Sam Hazeldine.

10
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Jeremy, played by John Cenatiempo.

11
01:00:30,000 --> 01:00:36,000
Mechanic: Resurrection is a 2016 American action thriller film directed by Dennis Gansel and
written by Philip Shelby and Tony Mosher, with a story by Shelby and Brian Pittman.

12
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
It is the sequel to the 2011 film The Mechanic, which was a
remake of the 1972 film of the same name.

13
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
The film stars Jason Statham, Tommy Lee Jones, Jessica Alba, and Michelle Yeoh.

14
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Mechanic: Resurrection premiered in Hollywood on August 22, 2016, and was
theatrically released in the United States on August 26, 2016.

15
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
It received generally negative reviews from critics, but grossed $125 million worldwide
against a budget of $40 million, eclipsing the total of its predecessor.

16
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The film explores themes of assassin, sequel, murder, mechanic, killer.

17
01:33:30,000 --> 01:33:36,000
The tone is intense.
